# CrossNotes UI/UX (agent rules)

Full rules: `docs/DESIGN_RULES.md`. Roadmap: `docs/UX_OVERHAUL_PLAN.md`. Follow those; this file is the short enforce list.

## Never do

- Add theme/sound toggles (or other “quick settings”) to `AppHeader` — Settings only.
- Rotate/skew cards or stack neon/glow decoration on study content.
- Dump multiple widgets into the Dashboard first viewport (keep one primary CTA).
- Attach streaks to app-open; shame users for broken streaks; remove freeze education.
- Ship decorative images or diagrams with labels far from the figure.
- Play SFX on every navigation/click; host remote audio URLs for core SFX.
- Invent a second settings/install UI parallel to the existing Settings/install sheet.

## Always do

- One job per screen; prefs in Settings; install = platform-correct PWA flow.
- Notes: readable type; `figure` / labeled `diagram` with spatial contiguity; expand large figures.
- Sounds for learning events only; mute owned by Settings.
- Streaks for real study completions; recovery + freeze clarity; update `DESIGN_RULES.md` if formula changes.
- Kill decorative card rotation (subjects/stats/tilts).
- Prefer `--elev-0/1/2` over thick clay offset shadows on content.
- Dashboard first viewport: greeting + streak/XP + one primary CTA only.

## Before finishing UI work

Run the checklist in `docs/DESIGN_RULES.md` §8 mentally and fix violations.
